{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["All Purpose Cultural Cat Girl Nuku Nuku","When Ryunosuke's pet cat dies in an accident, his inventor father \"resurrects\" the cat by placing its brain in an android body made in the form of a young girl. The Android, Nukunuku, has the dual purposes of being a companion/sister for Ryunosuke as well as being a bodyguard for his father. Nukunuku's extreme strength and feline agility are regularly needed to protect Ryunosuke and his father from Ryunusuke's mother who seeks to kidnap them both following her divorce from his father. Her motives towards Ryunusuke are simple motherly love, however her genius-inventor-ex-husband she wants to put to work designing weapons of mass destruction for her weapons company.\n\n\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"],"ja":["万能文化猫娘",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-373","ids":{"shikimori":373,"mal":373,"anilist":373,"kodik":"serial-53290"},"kodikIds":["serial-27604","serial-56835","serial-53290"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-27604":"2020-07-09T15:04:28Z","serial-56835":"2024-01-14T16:47:15Z","serial-53290":"2023-08-29T16:41:48Z"},"title":"Универсальная современная девушка-кошка","originalTitle":"Bannou Bunka Nekomusume","alt":"All Purpose Cultural Cat Girl Nuku Nuku All Purpose Cultural Cat Girl Nuku Nuku 万能文化猫娘","description":"Когда домашняя кошка Рюносукэ Нацумэ погибает в аварии, его отец-изобретатель Кюсаку Нацумэ, по прозвищу Мистер Кью, «оживляет» питомца, поместив её мозг в тело андроида, выполненного в виде молодой девушки. Андроид, названный Нуку-Нуку, был создан с двойной целью: с одной стороны, он должен быть кем-то вроде компаньона-сестры для Рюносукэ, с другой — телохранителем его отца. Огромная сила и кошачья ловкость Нуку-Нуку не раз пригодятся для того, чтобы защитить Рюносукэ и Кюсаку от Акико Нацумэ, бывшей жены Кюсаку, пытающейся похитить их обоих: Рюносукэ — из-за обычной материнской любви, а бывшего-мужа-гениального-изобретателя — чтобы заставить его разрабатывать оружие массового поражения для её оружейной компании.","year":1992,"type":"OVA","genres":["сэйнэн","Приключения","Комедия","Фантастика","меха"],"rating":6.73,"popularity":5169,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/373/e35b4a28dfdd66c2afe125b15b78076f.jpeg","width":315,"height":450},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/banner/n373-yZAAEXthlFcg.jpg","width":1173,"height":400}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2,3,4,5,6],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-1360","dubId":"1360","label":"Листочек","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-27604","translationId":"1360","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/683122/9ff25ce830e6d0e56ac3900def0036d8/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}},{"id":"kodik-869","dubId":"869","label":"Субтитры","language":"ja","original":true,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-56835","translationId":"869","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1259301/1b5ad4b665fd27a871b9a47773433bf7/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}},{"id":"kodik-827","dubId":"827","label":"Persona99","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-53290","translationId":"827","url":"https://kodikplayer.com/seria/1192451/85eef6929c5415483b43e69ef398ccc4/720p","season":1,"ordinal":1}}]},{"number":2,"ordinal":2,"season":1,"audio":[{"id":"kodik-1360","dubId":"1360","label":"Листочек","language":"ru","original":false,"duration":null,"sources":[],"subtitles":[],"opening":null,"ending":null,"validation":"provider-link","providerRef":{"provider":"kodik","releaseId":"serial-276